  {
   "unit_type": "entry",
   "text": "Warm-Massage Breast Pump | Heat + Massage + Suction | Personalize Your Experience | Momcozy {keyword:breast pump} | Wearable, Heated & Cordless | Soothe Let-Down & Fullness | 3 Warmth Levels, 3 Massage | Pump Gently, Flow Faster | Up to 10 Pumps Per Charge | Earlier Let-Down, Less Pull | Wearable Warmth & Comfort | Comfort in Every Detail | Expert-Led Milk Boost Mode | Momcozy W1 Warm Massage Pump | Momcozy Wellness 1 | Momcozy Wellness 1: warmth, rhythmic massage & suction in one wearable pump. | 3 warmth levels + gentle massage help relax ducts, speed let-down & ease fullness. | 70% of moms felt earlier let-down & less pulling. The original warm-massage pump. | Pay monthly from $31.52 with Klarna or Afterpay. 30-day returns, 1-yr warranty.",
